{%- comment -%}
  GARELON · Envío gratis + pago seguro debajo de los botones de compra.

  - «Envío gratis»: solo comunica la oferta. La tarifa real (0 €) se configura en
    Shopify Admin › Configuración › Envío y entrega; el tema no la controla.
  - Métodos de pago: SOLO los que Shopify tiene habilitados (shop.enabled_payment_types),
    con los SVG oficiales de Shopify (payment_type_svg_tag), igual que el pie de página de Dawn.
    Ningún logo está escrito a mano ni subido como imagen: si un método se desactiva en
    Shopify, desaparece aquí automáticamente.
  - No toca {{ form | payment_button }} ni el checkout: es información visual.
  - Sin garantías ni plazos inventados.

  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} bloque garelon_payment_trust

  Usage:
  {% render 'garelon-payment-trust', block: block %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign show_shipping = false
  if block.settings.show_free_shipping and block.settings.free_shipping_label != blank
    assign show_shipping = true
  endif
  assign show_payment = false
  if block.settings.show_payment and block.settings.payment_label != blank
    assign show_payment = true
  endif
  assign show_icons = false
  if block.settings.show_icons and shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0
    assign show_icons = true
  endif
-%}
{%- if show_shipping or show_payment or show_icons -%}
  <div class="g-buytrust" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- if show_shipping or show_payment -%}
      <ul class="g-buytrust__list" role="list">
        {%- if show_shipping -%}
          <li class="g-buytrust__item">
            <span class="g-buytrust__icon">{% render 'garelon-icon', icon: 'check' %}</span>
            <span class="g-buytrust__text">
              <span class="g-buytrust__label">{{ block.settings.free_shipping_label | escape }}</span>
              {%- if block.settings.free_shipping_note != blank -%}
                <span class="g-buytrust__note">{{ block.settings.free_shipping_note | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if show_payment -%}
          <li class="g-buytrust__item">
            <span class="g-buytrust__icon">{% render 'garelon-icon', icon: 'lock' %}</span>
            <span class="g-buytrust__text">
              <span class="g-buytrust__label">{{ block.settings.payment_label | escape }}</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if show_icons -%}
      <ul class="g-pay" role="list" aria-label="{{ block.settings.payment_list_label | default: 'Métodos de pago aceptados' | escape }}">
        {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
          <li class="g-pay__item">
            {{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'icon icon--full-color g-pay__icon' }}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- elsif block.settings.show_icons and request.design_mode -%}
      <p class="g-editor-note" role="note">
        Shopify no devuelve ningún método de pago habilitado, así que no se muestran iconos. Actívalos en
        Configuración › Pagos. Aviso visible solo en el editor de temas.
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
